# Host runtime baseline: C/C++ runtime, newlib and POSIX symbols the
# PocketMage firmware exports unconditionally. Apps may rely on these
# without listing them. Generated from the firmware's ELF_SYMS export
# table (src/ELF_SYMS/esp_all_symbol.cpp); regenerate alongside
# symbols.list when the host export surface changes. Do not hand edit.
#
# The gate treats these as resolvable when no --host-elf is supplied, so
# a standalone app checkout can be gated without the firmware tree.

